# document-service - deploy/env/document.env (copy from this file; never commit the real one).
# Only what document-service reads at runtime and compose does NOT set. Compose already sets the wiring
# (ports, DATABASE_URL, REDIS_*, RABBITMQ_URL, *_GRPC_URL, JWT_*, SERVICE_CLIENT_SECRET) from deploy/.env.
# Empty KEY= lines are required values; commented lines are optional tunables with their default.

# Nothing secret: every value is wired by compose (broker user `document`, r2 gRPC URL, service token,
# R2_PUBLIC_URL). No Redis either.
